### ============================================
### EXPERIENCIA LABORAL — REST Client
### ============================================
### Primero haz login para obtener el token.
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "user": "1193377218",
    "pass": "1193377218"
}

### ============================================
### EXPERIENCIA LABORAL
### ============================================

### 1. VER experiencias por usuario
GET http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias?id_usuario=1

### 2. VER experiencias activas (sin fecha de retiro)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias/activas?id_usuario=1

### 3. VER resumen de experiencias (total empresas, años, activas)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias/resumen?id_usuario=1

### 4. CREAR experiencia laboral con certificado (multipart/form-data)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_user"

11047
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nombre_empresa"

Tech Solutions S.A.S
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cargo"

Desarrollador Full Stack
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_ingreso"

2022-03-01
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_retiro"

2024-06-15
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="certificado_trabajo"; filename="certificado.pdf"; filename*="UTF-8''certificado.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:/Users/Soporte/Downloads/seguimiento_equipo_computo_2026-07-03-08-28-49.pdf
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_certificado"

2024-06-20
--WebAppBoundary--

### 5. CREAR experiencia actual sin certificado
POST http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_user"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nombre_empresa"

InnovateTech Ltda
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cargo"

Líder Técnico
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fecha_ingreso"

2024-07-01
--WebAppBoundary--

### 6. ACTUALIZAR experiencia con nuevo certificado (reemplaza el anterior)
### NOTA: usar POST + _method=PUT para multipart/form-data en Laravel
POST http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="_method"

PUT
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id_user"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cargo"

Desarrollador Senior
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="certificado_trabajo"; filename="certificado_nuevo.pdf"; filename*="UTF-8''certificado_nuevo.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:/Users/Soporte/Downloads/seguimiento_equipo_computo_2026-07-03-08-28-49.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 7. ELIMINAR experiencia por id
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id": 1
}

### 8. ELIMINAR todas las experiencias de un usuario
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/info-perfil/experiencias/usuario
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "id_usuario": 1
}
